# Audio is NOT in this repo.
#
# The wavs are ripped from Black Ops 2 and CS2 and are not mine to redistribute here.
# They ship in the release build only. Keeping them out of git also keeps them out of
# history, which is the part that cannot be undone later.
#
# mapping.json IS tracked: it is my own work and the mod needs it to build.
sounds/**/*.wav
sounds/**/*.mp3
sounds/**/*.flac

